  <header class="hero">
    <h1>Keep your coding-agent configuration in sync across machines.</h1>
    <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="hero-copy"><p class="hero-description">OCP keeps your agents, skills, plugins, and settings in sync across machines, without copying a trail of folders and files by hand. <span class="harness-note">Currently works with <a href="https://opencode.ai/">OpenCode</a></span>; other harnesses coming soon!</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="#getting-started">Get started</a><a class="text-link" href="{{ '/docs/' | url }}">Read the docs</a></div></div>
    <img class="hero-illustration" src="{{ '/ocp-schematic.png' | url }}" width="1536" height="1024" alt="OCP synchronizes one configuration of agents, skills, plugins, settings, and profiles across a laptop and desktop computers.">
